<title>HUNGARY: BASKETBALL-WOMEN'S EUROPEAN CHAMPIONSHIP SEMIFINAL RESULTS.</title>
<headline>BASKETBALL-WOMEN'S EUROPEAN CHAMPIONSHIP SEMIFINAL RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-06-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results in the women's European</p>
<p>basketball championship semifinals on Saturday:</p>
<p>Slovakia beat Hungary 81-55 (halftime 37-28)</p>
<p>Leading scorers:</p>
<p>Slovakia - Anna Kotocova 18, Renata Hirakova 15, Iveta</p>
<p>Bielikova 11</p>
<p>Hungary - Andrea Karolyi 18, Dora Kalmar-Nagy 8, Judit Balogh</p>
<p>7, Agnes Nemeth 7.</p>
<p>Lithuania beat Germany 78-77 after extension (halftime</p>
<p>34-33, end of second half 70-70)</p>
<p>Leading scorers:</p>
<p>Lithuania - Jurgita Streimikyte 18, Dalia Kurtinaitiene 17,</p>
<p>Lina Dambrauskaite 14</p>
<p>Germany - Petra Kremer 18, Marlies Askamp 16, Heike Ruth 14</p>
</text>
